    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Junkienator, you are a janitor with one task: <strong>clean up</strong> chaotic offices armed with your trusty vacuum cleaner. But it's not just about common dirt. You'll have to face <strong>animated junk</strong> that gets in your way muttering insults, and pesky <strong>black creatures</strong> that leave black stains everywhere. You'll use cunning, your tools, and even common objects in unexpected ways to make your way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the job is done and you return home, everything changes. <strong>Creaking walls</strong> await you, a <strong>mother lost</strong> in her beloved vintage films, and the darkness of the night, populated by <strong>dark dreams</strong> that haunt your nights and try to resurface, forcing you to confront buried truths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Vacuum, Throw, and Clean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The offices aren't just dirty, they're... alive! Use your powerful vacuum cleaner to suck up the annoying <strong>animated junk</strong> that hinders you and curses you under its breath. Watch out for the <strong>black creatures:</strong> these little things mess everything up! Kill them, then use water to erase their remains. Cleaning here is also self-defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/94118237fb4529740e3856b71bf29600.poster.avif?t=1750495970\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/94118237fb4529740e3856b71bf29600.webm?t=1750495970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve the Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything is easily accessible. <strong>Some areas are off-limits</strong>; find a way to access them and complete your clean-up job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/9b49c05f2b8f84b8cad7457bd6ba18b5.poster.avif?t=1750495970\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/9b49c05f2b8f84b8cad7457bd6ba18b5.webm?t=1750495970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Back home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the day, you return to your <strong>sweet and gloomy home</strong>. Say hi to Mom, do some chores, and try to get some rest. You've earned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/54b51901dbf4d9a4cc0ccab295be4dce.poster.avif?t=1750495970\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/54b51901dbf4d9a4cc0ccab295be4dce.webm?t=1750495970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face your nightmares</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rest brings no peace. <strong>Every night</strong>, you plunge into <strong>vivid</strong> and <strong>terrifying</strong> nightmares that seem more real than they should be. Confront your past as it resurfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/5da28f8a838cb0698b957887fc895b17.poster.avif?t=1750495970\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080700/extras/5da28f8a838cb0698b957887fc895b17.webm?t=1750495970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
